# The repo-root .gitignore has an unanchored `runs/` pattern meant for
# bim-orchestrator's per-run artifact folders (audit output) — being
# unanchored, it also matches this app's src/features/runs/ (React feature
# folder for the Run/Results pages), silently untracking it. Re-include it
# here since the fix belongs with the app, not the artifact-folder rule.
!src/features/runs/
